        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "SCI / European steel partners: Steel Buildings in Europe, Part 10, Technical Software Specification.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_nx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 25513,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "SCI P359 (2011) §4.2.3: Nc = η Nc,f; linear interaction conservative. η_min rule §4.4.3.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
